@freeway_HostAddress = http://localhost:8080
@projectKey = fw_your-project-key

### Chat completion
POST {{freeway_HostAddress}}/v1/chat/completions
Authorization: Bearer {{projectKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "free",
  "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "Hello!"}]
}

### Streamed chat completion (server-sent events, ending in data: [DONE])
POST {{freeway_HostAddress}}/v1/chat/completions
Authorization: Bearer {{projectKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "paid:moderate",
  "stream": true,
  "stream_options": {"include_usage": true},
  "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "Count to ten."}]
}

### Models, in OpenAI's list format
GET {{freeway_HostAddress}}/v1/models
Authorization: Bearer {{projectKey}}

###
